---
import Analytics from '../components/Analytics.astro';
import BrandLogo from '../components/BrandLogo.astro';
import BrandTheme from '../components/BrandTheme.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <Analytics />
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy note — AgenQuest</title>
  <meta name="description" content="How AgenQuest handles information submitted through its AI visibility audit.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#165A40">
  <style is:inline>
    @layer site-base {
    :root{--bg:#FAFAF7;--ink:#14120F;--soft:#55524B;--line:#E4E1D8;--accent:#E8450A;--sans:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;--serif:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;--mono:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.7 var(--sans)}
    header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}nav,main,footer{max-width:820px;margin:auto;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}nav{height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}a{color:inherit}.logo{font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.back{font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--soft)}main{padding-top:86px;padding-bottom:100px}p.kicker{font:12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:18px}h1{font:600 clamp(48px,8vw,76px)/.95 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:28px}.intro{font-size:20px;color:var(--soft);max-width:660px;margin-bottom:60px}section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;gap:35px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0}h2{font:500 13px var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}section p,section li{color:var(--soft)}ul{padding-left:18px}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:42px;color:var(--soft);font-size:14px}@media(max-width:620px){main{padding-top:58px}section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}
    }
  </style>
  <BrandTheme />
</head>
<body>
  <header><nav><BrandLogo /><a class="back" href="/">← Back to the site</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <p class="kicker">Plain-language privacy note</p>
    <h1>What happens to your information.</h1>
    <p class="intro">The audit asks for only what is needed to generate and send the result. This page explains the current workflow without hiding it behind legal shorthand.</p>
    <section><h2>What we collect</h2><div><p>Your brand or website, the audit questions you select, the generated report, your email address and an optional phone number.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Why we use it</h2><div><p>To run the audit, email its result, understand your brand context and send one relevant follow-up about the findings.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Services involved</h2><div><p>Audit prompts are processed through OpenAI. Report delivery and contact handling use Resend. Cloudflare hosts the site and stores submitted leads privately so a failed notification does not lose your enquiry. These providers process the information needed for their part of the workflow. Requesting an audit does not subscribe you to marketing emails.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Optional analytics</h2><div><p>With your permission, Google Analytics measures traffic sources, page visits, reading and progress through the audit. Microsoft Clarity records masked interactions to help us understand usability. These tools load only after you accept analytics. Audit fields, selected questions and report contents are masked in Clarity; contact details and report text are not sent to Google Analytics.</p><p>Consented source information is kept in your browser for up to 90 days, including the first known source, the current session and the last known non-direct source. When you submit the audit, it is saved with your lead to help us understand which activity produced an enquiry. Links and campaign labels should never contain personal information.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Analytics choices</h2><div><p>Accept or reject optional analytics using the privacy choices control on any page. Your choice is remembered for six months. You can withdraw permission there at any time; the audit continues to work. Cloudflare separately processes basic request and security information to operate and protect the site. Some traffic sources cannot be identified when a browser or another service hides them.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Your choices</h2><div><p>The phone field is optional. You can ask us to delete your submitted contact information or stop follow-up at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:audit@agenquest.com">audit@agenquest.com</a>.</p></div></section>
    <section><h2>Questions</h2><div><p>Email <a href="mailto:audit@agenquest.com">audit@agenquest.com</a>. We will update this note if the audit workflow or its service providers materially change.</p></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer>Last updated 16 October 2026 · AgenQuest</footer>
</body>
</html>
